WEBVTT

00:00:07.537 --> 00:00:11.411
[ SIGHS ]

00:00:11.454 --> 00:00:14.414
Molly: HARRY!

00:00:14.457 --> 00:00:17.243
HAGRID!

00:00:17.286 --> 00:00:19.201
WHAT HAPPENED?

00:00:19.245 --> 00:00:21.247
WHERE ARE
THE OTHERS?

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:22.944
IS NO ONE ELSE BACK?

00:00:22.987 --> 00:00:24.598
Hagrid: THEY WERE ON US
RIGHT FROM THE START, MOLLY.

00:00:24.641 --> 00:00:26.643
WE DIDN'T
STAND A CHANCE.

00:00:26.687 --> 00:00:29.733
WELL...THANK GOODNESS
YOU TWO ARE ALL RIGHT.

00:00:29.777 --> 00:00:32.432
THE DEATH EATERS
WERE WAITING FOR US.
IT WAS AN AMBUSH.

00:00:32.475 --> 00:00:34.260
RON AND TONKS
SHOULD'VE ALREADY BEEN BACK.

00:00:34.303 --> 00:00:36.349
DAD AND FRED, AS WELL.

00:00:36.392 --> 00:00:37.611
[ WHOOSHING ]

00:00:37.654 --> 00:00:40.135
Lupin: HERE!

00:00:40.179 --> 00:00:42.268
QUICK!

00:00:42.311 --> 00:00:44.618
INTO THE HOUSE!

00:00:44.661 --> 00:00:47.708
[ GRUNTING ]

00:00:47.751 --> 00:00:50.493
OH, MY BOY!

00:00:50.537 --> 00:00:52.495
[ BOTH GRUNTING ]

00:00:52.539 --> 00:00:53.757
OH!

00:00:53.801 --> 00:00:55.019
OH!

00:00:55.063 --> 00:00:56.412
[ GRUNTS ]

00:00:56.456 --> 00:00:58.327
Hagrid: LUPIN!Ginny:
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?!

00:00:58.371 --> 00:01:00.634
SHH!
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:01:00.677 --> 00:01:03.593
[ Panting ] WHAT CREATURE
SAT IN THE CORNER

00:01:03.637 --> 00:01:07.380
THE FIRST TIME HARRY POTTER
VISITED MY OFFICE IN HOGWARTS?

00:01:07.423 --> 00:01:09.120
ARE YOU MAD?!
WHAT CREATURE?!

00:01:09.164 --> 00:01:10.992
A-A GRINDYLOW.

00:01:11.035 --> 00:01:12.733
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:01:16.954 --> 00:01:19.087
WE'VE BEEN BETRAYED.

00:01:19.130 --> 00:01:21.785
VOLDEMORT KNEW
YOU WERE BEING MOVED TONIGHT.

00:01:21.829 --> 00:01:24.962
I HAD TO MAKE SURE
YOU WEREN'T AN IMPOSTOR.

00:01:27.313 --> 00:01:28.792
[ WHOOSHING ]

00:01:30.403 --> 00:01:32.143
WAIT!

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:38.193
THE LAST WORDS...

00:01:38.237 --> 00:01:40.848
ALBUS DUMBLEDORE SPOKE
TO THE PAIR OF US?

00:01:40.891 --> 00:01:42.371
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:01:42.415 --> 00:01:45.374
"HARRY IS THE BEST HOPE
WE HAVE.

00:01:45.418 --> 00:01:46.984
TRUST HIM."

00:01:48.856 --> 00:01:51.032
[ SIGHS ]

00:01:51.075 --> 00:01:52.642
WHAT GAVE YOU AWAY?

00:01:52.686 --> 00:01:54.253
HEDWIG, I THINK.

00:01:54.296 --> 00:01:56.037
SHE WAS
TRYING TO PROTECT ME.

00:01:56.080 --> 00:01:57.343
[ WHOOSHING ]

00:01:57.386 --> 00:01:59.562
[ THESTRAL SCREECHES,
WINGS FLAPPING ]

00:02:03.305 --> 00:02:04.959
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:02:08.702 --> 00:02:10.878
OH!

00:02:10.921 --> 00:02:12.140
[ SIGHS ]

00:02:12.183 --> 00:02:13.446
THANKS.

00:02:13.489 --> 00:02:16.100
Tonks: DESERVES THAT.
BRILLIANT, HE WAS.

00:02:16.144 --> 00:02:18.494
I WOULDN'T BE STANDING HERE
WITHOUT HIM.

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:20.235
REALLY?

00:02:20.279 --> 00:02:22.716
ALWAYS THE TONE
OF SURPRISE.

00:02:22.759 --> 00:02:24.021
[ SIGHS ]

00:02:27.198 --> 00:02:30.767
[ WHOOSHING ]

00:02:30.811 --> 00:02:32.421
WE THE LAST BACK?

00:02:32.465 --> 00:02:34.728
WHERE'S GEORGE?

00:02:55.488 --> 00:02:58.317
HOW YOU FEELING,
GEORGIE?

00:03:00.101 --> 00:03:01.842
SAINT-LIKE.

00:03:01.885 --> 00:03:04.279
COME AGAIN?

00:03:04.323 --> 00:03:06.542
SAINT-LIKE.

00:03:06.586 --> 00:03:08.892
I'M HOLY.

00:03:08.936 --> 00:03:11.112
I'M HOLEY,FRED.

00:03:11.155 --> 00:03:12.374
GET IT?

00:03:12.418 --> 00:03:13.636
[ CHUCKLES ]

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:16.204
THE WHOLE WIDE WORLD
OF EAR-RELATED HUMOR,

00:03:16.247 --> 00:03:18.859
AND YOU GO
FOR "I'M HOLY."

00:03:18.902 --> 00:03:20.208
THAT'S PATHETIC.

00:03:20.251 --> 00:03:23.037
RECKON I'M STILL
BETTER-LOOKING THAN YOU.

00:03:26.127 --> 00:03:28.042
MAD-EYE'S DEAD.

00:03:33.482 --> 00:03:35.266
[ SIGHS ]

00:03:38.313 --> 00:03:41.534
MUNDUNGUS TOOK ONE LOOK
AT VOLDEMORT AND...

00:03:41.577 --> 00:03:42.926
DISAPPARATED.

00:04:05.035 --> 00:04:07.908
Mad-Eye:
HEAD FOR THE BURROWS![ VOLDEMORT BREATHING]

00:04:07.951 --> 00:04:09.649
Dumbledore: THIS IS BEYOND
ANYTHING I IMAGINED.

00:04:09.692 --> 00:04:11.433
Slughorn: SEVEN?Tom Riddle: SEVEN?

00:04:11.477 --> 00:04:13.130
SEVEN?
A HORCRUX.

00:04:13.174 --> 00:04:15.002
Harry: THEY COULD BE HIDDEN
ANYWHERE, COULDN'T THEY?

00:04:15.045 --> 00:04:16.830
TO RIP THE SOUL
INTO SEVEN PIECES...

00:04:16.873 --> 00:04:18.701
WHAT IF YOU DID DESTROY
EACH HORCRUX?

00:04:18.745 --> 00:04:20.616
Dumbledore:
ONE DESTROYS VOLDEMORT.

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:23.663
[ VOLDEMORT BREATHING]

00:04:23.706 --> 00:04:25.229
TRUST ME.

00:04:25.273 --> 00:04:27.580
Voldemort:
YOU LIED TO ME --

00:04:27.623 --> 00:04:29.756
LIED TO ME, OLLIVANDER.

00:04:29.799 --> 00:04:30.974
NO.

00:04:31.018 --> 00:04:34.630
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:04:54.781 --> 00:04:57.914
[ DOOR OPENS ]

00:05:01.527 --> 00:05:04.181
GOING SOMEWHERE?

00:05:06.619 --> 00:05:09.752
NOBODY ELSE
IS GOING TO DIE...

00:05:09.796 --> 00:05:11.362
NOT FOR ME.

00:05:11.406 --> 00:05:13.495
FOR YOU?

00:05:13.539 --> 00:05:15.758
YOU THINK MAD-EYE DIED
FOR YOU?

00:05:15.802 --> 00:05:19.109
YOU THINK GEORGE
TOOK THAT CURSE FOR YOU?

00:05:19.153 --> 00:05:21.808
YOU MAY BE
THE CHOSEN ONE, MATE,

00:05:21.851 --> 00:05:23.853
BUT THIS IS
A WHOLE LOT BIGGER THAN THAT.

00:05:23.897 --> 00:05:25.681
IT'S ALWAYS BEEN BIGGER
THAN THAT.

00:05:28.205 --> 00:05:30.947
COME WITH ME.
WHAT,
AND LEAVE HERMIONE?

00:05:30.991 --> 00:05:32.383
ARE YOU MAD?

00:05:32.427 --> 00:05:34.864
WE WOULDN'T LAST TWO DAYS
WITHOUT HER.

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:38.564
DON'T TELL HER
I SAID THAT.

00:05:38.607 --> 00:05:41.392
BESIDES...

00:05:41.436 --> 00:05:43.220
YOU'VE STILL GOT
THE TRACE ON YOU.

00:05:43.264 --> 00:05:44.744
WE'VE STILL GOT
THE WEDDING.

00:05:44.787 --> 00:05:47.573
LOOK, I DON'T CARE
ABOUT A WEDDING --

00:05:47.616 --> 00:05:49.879
I'M SORRY --
NO MATTER WHOSE IT IS.

00:05:49.923 --> 00:05:52.491
I HAVE TO START FINDING
THESE HORCRUXES.

00:05:52.534 --> 00:05:54.841
THEY'RE OUR ONLY CHANCE
TO BEAT HIM,

00:05:54.884 --> 00:05:57.931
AND THE LONGER WE STAY HERE,
THE STRONGER HE GETS.

00:05:57.974 --> 00:06:00.890
TONIGHT'S
NOT THE NIGHT, MATE.

00:06:00.934 --> 00:06:03.893
WE'D ONLY BE DOING HIM
A FAVOR.

00:06:03.937 --> 00:06:05.939
[ SIGHS ]

00:06:12.728 --> 00:06:14.338
[ SIGHS ]

00:06:14.382 --> 00:06:16.384
[ THUD ]

00:06:27.656 --> 00:06:31.660
[ SIGHS ]

00:06:31.704 --> 00:06:33.793
DO YOU THINK
HE KNOWS?

00:06:33.836 --> 00:06:35.272
I MEAN...

00:06:35.316 --> 00:06:38.667
THEY'RE BITS OF HIS SOUL,
THESE HORCRUXES,

00:06:38.711 --> 00:06:40.016
BITS OF HIM.

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:42.758
WHEN DUMBLEDORE
DESTROYED THE RING,

00:06:42.802 --> 00:06:45.587
YOU DESTROYED
TOM RIDDLE'S DIARY,

00:06:45.631 --> 00:06:48.851
HE MUST HAVE FELT
SOMETHING.

00:06:48.895 --> 00:06:54.291
BUT TO KILL THE OTHER HORCRUXES,
WE HAVE TO FIND THEM.

00:06:54.335 --> 00:06:56.163
WHERE ARE THEY?

00:06:56.206 --> 00:06:58.295
WHERE DO WE START?

00:06:58.339 --> 00:07:02.082
[ DOOR OPENS, CLOSES ]

00:07:02.125 --> 00:07:04.563
Fred: [ In distance ]
READY WHEN YOU ARE!

00:07:04.606 --> 00:07:07.435
Arthur: [ In distance ]
RON! FRED! PAY ATTENTION!

00:07:07.478 --> 00:07:09.655
IT'S YOUR BROTHER'S WEDDING!
BUCK UP!

00:07:09.698 --> 00:07:13.049
[ INDISTINCT SHOUTING ]

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:28.891
[ DOORS SLAM ]

00:07:32.895 --> 00:07:35.028
[ FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING ]

00:07:35.071 --> 00:07:37.552
Ginny:
ZIP ME UP, WILL YOU?

